14:["$","section","North: the airport belt",{"id":"north-the-airport-belt","className":"mb-12 last:mb-0","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.65rem] leading-snug text-[var(--sheet-ink)] sm:text-[2rem]","children":"North: the airport belt"}],[["$","p","The airport corridor is priced against e",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"The airport corridor is priced against employment rather than scenery: airport operations, the KIADB aerospace and hardware SEZ, and the business park around Devanahalli. Rental demand is real here, which is why the desk’s airport-corridor listings are apartments rather than open plots."}],["$","p","The risk is brochure distance. Five minu",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"The risk is brochure distance. Five minutes to a terminal is a claim about a specific gate and a specific road; check it at peak hour before paying for proximity."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
15:["$","section","North-west: Chikkaballapura and the Nandi foothills",{"id":"north-west-chikkaballapura-and-the-nandi-foothills","className":"mb-12 last:mb-0","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.65rem] leading-snug text-[var(--sheet-ink)] sm:text-[2rem]","children":"North-west: Chikkaballapura and the Nandi foothills"}],[["$","p","This is where land is still land: plots ",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"This is where land is still land: plots from ₹35 lakh, a district town with its own hospitals and colleges, and the Nandi Hills ridge as the backdrop. Layouts here are typically sanctioned for the local planning area with RERA registration per phase."}],["$","p","The honest trade-off is time. This is no",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"The honest trade-off is time. This is not a daily commute to Whitefield or Electronic City, and the desk says so before a site visit. It suits a weekend home, a long-horizon land position, or a buyer who wants to build later at a lower land cost."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
16:["$","section","South: Jigani, APC Circle and Kanakapura Road",{"id":"south-jigani-apc-circle-and-kanakapura-road","className":"mb-12 last:mb-0","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.65rem] leading-snug text-[var(--sheet-ink)] sm:text-[2rem]","children":"South: Jigani, APC Circle and Kanakapura Road"}],[["$","p","The south belt is the most urban of the ",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"The south belt is the most urban of the plotted corridors: employment at Electronic City and the Jigani industrial area, and road access through NICE Road. Prices reflect city reach rather than views, and layouts vary from industrial-adjacent plots to villa enclaves off Bannerghatta Road."}],["$","p","Ask about the approach road and the drai",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"Ask about the approach road and the drainage before the price. Industrial belts can have heavy vehicles and patchy last-mile access that a masterplan drawing does not show."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
17:["$","section","How to choose between them",{"id":"how-to-choose-between-them","className":"mb-12 last:mb-0","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.65rem] leading-snug text-[var(--sheet-ink)] sm:text-[2rem]","children":"How to choose between them"}],"$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-[68ch] space-y-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-ink)]","children":[["$","li","Write down the horizon: under three year",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-[var(--gold-on-light)]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Write down the horizon: under three years, a plot rarely beats a rented flat; over seven, land in a funded corridor usually deserves a look."}]]}],["$","li","Check what is already built, not what is",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-[var(--gold-on-light)]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Check what is already built, not what is proposed. A ring-road interchange under construction is different from one in a chief minister’s speech."}]]}],["$","li","Price the holding cost: tax, upkeep, and",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-[var(--gold-on-light)]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Price the holding cost: tax, upkeep, and the years before you build."}]]}],["$","li","Visit at 9am and again at 7pm. Access an",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-[var(--gold-on-light)]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Visit at 9am and again at 7pm. Access and noise change with the hour."}]]}],["$","li","Read the papers before you fall for the ",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-[var(--gold-on-light)]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Read the papers before you fall for the view — the approvals checklist is on this site."}]]}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
18:["$","section","What this page is not",{"id":"what-this-page-is-not","className":"mb-12 last:mb-0","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.65rem] leading-snug text-[var(--sheet-ink)] sm:text-[2rem]","children":"What this page is not"}],[["$","p","Growth percentages published elsewhere o",{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"Growth percentages published elsewhere on this site are the desk’s corridor commentary, not audited returns, and they are not a forecast. Nobody can promise a ranking of areas that will hold for your holding period. What can be checked is access, approval, title and what has been delivered."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
19:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-[1.5rem] text-[var(--sheet-ink)]","children":"Sources"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-[16px]","children":[["$","li","https://bmrda.karnataka.gov.in/8/local-planning-areas/en",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://bmrda.karnataka.gov.in/8/local-planning-areas/en","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4","children":"BMRDA — local planning authorities"}]}],["$","li","https://rera.karnataka.gov.in/",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://rera.karnataka.gov.in/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4","children":"Karnataka RERA"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-[64ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"This guide explains procedure and paperwork. It is not legal, tax or investment advice, and it does not replace an independent lawyer or lender check on the specific property."}]]}]
